% us:policies/usda/snap/fy-2024-cola/maximum-allotments
the text of "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments" is at "sources/us/policies/usda/snap/fy-2024-cola/maximum-allotments.yaml".

% The row in force on the calculation date, of the table's dated versions below.
the snap maximum allotment table for a household size is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and the snap maximum allotment table for the household size from a date N to a date M is the amount
    and N <= D
    and D <= M.

the snap maximum allotment table for 1 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 291, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 2 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 535, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 3 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 766, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 4 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 973, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 5 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 1155, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 6 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 1386, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 7 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 1532, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap maximum allotment table for 8 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 1751, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

rule snap_maximum_allotment_additional_member with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap maximum allotment additional member is 219 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D.

rule snap_maximum_allotment with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap maximum allotment of a household is an amount N if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and the household size of the household is a number M
    and the minimum of M and 8 is a number K
    and the maximum of K and 1 is a number P
    and the snap maximum allotment table for P is an amount Q
    and the snap maximum allotment additional member is an amount R
    and a number S = M - 8
    and the maximum of S and 0 is a number T
    and N = Q + T * R.

rule snap_one_person_thrifty_food_plan_cost with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap one person thrifty food plan cost of a household is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and the household is a household
    and the snap maximum allotment table for 1 is the amount.

